    "detailed_description": "Tank vs. Aliens is a top-down shooter reminiscent of the flash games circa early 00s. Fight to survive an endless onslaught of aliens, upgrading your tank between levels to keep up with the horde. Death may be inevitable in the aftermath of the invasion, but it is up to you to bring down as many of the these creatures as you can.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is the first full release by Jake Makes, and is a fairly short and simple title. With this being the case, Tank vs. Aliens will be free to play in browser. You are encouraged to try the game here before deciding to purchase. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttps://gx.games/games/vk1plz/tank-vs-aliens <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you wish to support further development, a purchase here on Steam would be hugely appreciated.",
